{"2597610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mononoke No Kuni", "steam_appid": 2597610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Small Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Musashi, a Shiba Inu, trusts you and follows you anywhere.<br>Pet him, and he will wag his tail with joy.If danger comes, he will help you.<br>—But the time you can spend together is limited.<br>Feed Musashi, train him, and dress him in ninja or samurai outfits.<br>Join forces and stand against the yokai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a38ebb45020b697d0302df617f9791f3.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a38ebb45020b697d0302df617f9791f3.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a38ebb45020b697d0302df617f9791f3.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The More You Master It, the More Exhilarating the Combat Becomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive, satisfying action.<br>Chain charge attacks, dodges, guards, and parries freely with your own hands.<br>A purification action system where, if you read the timing, you can deflect every attack.<br>Push through without taking a hit, or handle every strike with the smallest movements — it all depends on your skill.<br>Read, deflect, and build your flow. The more you master it, the more dazzling each battle becomes.<br>(<i>A casual mode is also available, so you can enjoy the story and your adventure with Musashi at your own pace.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a07315768ec6e32ac82c5f2b20306098.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a07315768ec6e32ac82c5f2b20306098.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a07315768ec6e32ac82c5f2b20306098.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not to Defeat Them. To Return Them to Yomi.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The yokai that block your path are not mere enemies.<br>Uncover the sorrowful truths hidden within Japanese folktales.<br>Why did they become yokai? What memories still bind them?<br>Wield the ōnusa, a sacred Japanese purification wand, touch their hearts, and soothe the lingering souls that cannot move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/86f9182c6f53545e3a1ba2570913e9d8.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/86f9182c6f53545e3a1ba2570913e9d8.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/86f9182c6f53545e3a1ba2570913e9d8.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mononoke Are Adorable, Even When They Need Help</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their village is being invaded by yokai, but the Mononoke still live their gentle, easygoing lives.<br>As the village is restored, you will grow closer to them little by little.<br>Help these strange and cheerful villagers, and spend time by their side.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/9b4c89f610772235e8e5eed39e403afd.avif?t=1783860973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras_big/9b4c89f610772235e8e5eed39e403afd.avif?t=1783860973 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Boy Carries Musashi’s Fate Forward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To recover Musashi’s soul, the boy must purify eight great yokai and make his way to the serpent god.<br>But is bringing back a lost life truly salvation? The shrine maidens who guide the boy are shrouded in mystery as well.<br>Your journey will change the fate of the puppy and this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/03c5f14a5cf77b01d5362862e73536d8.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/03c5f14a5cf77b01d5362862e73536d8.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/03c5f14a5cf77b01d5362862e73536d8.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Because He Wants to Stay with the Puppy, His Only Family, the Boy Chooses This Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please watch over where that wish leads by adding the game to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bond-driven action experience where you spend time with Musashi, raise him, and grow stronger together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles that reinterpret Japanese folklore, where you purify yokai with the ōnusa and return them to Yomi to soothe their souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stamina gauge, satisfying combat with stylish parries, and a casual mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore villages where Mononoke live, and restore a Japanese-inspired otherworld where the gods have fallen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Small Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Musashi, a Shiba Inu, trusts you and follows you anywhere.<br>Pet him, and he will wag his tail with joy.If danger comes, he will help you.<br>—But the time you can spend together is limited.<br>Feed Musashi, train him, and dress him in ninja or samurai outfits.<br>Join forces and stand against the yokai.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a38ebb45020b697d0302df617f9791f3.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a38ebb45020b697d0302df617f9791f3.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a38ebb45020b697d0302df617f9791f3.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The More You Master It, the More Exhilarating the Combat Becomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive, satisfying action.<br>Chain charge attacks, dodges, guards, and parries freely with your own hands.<br>A purification action system where, if you read the timing, you can deflect every attack.<br>Push through without taking a hit, or handle every strike with the smallest movements — it all depends on your skill.<br>Read, deflect, and build your flow. The more you master it, the more dazzling each battle becomes.<br>(<i>A casual mode is also available, so you can enjoy the story and your adventure with Musashi at your own pace.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a07315768ec6e32ac82c5f2b20306098.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a07315768ec6e32ac82c5f2b20306098.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/a07315768ec6e32ac82c5f2b20306098.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Not to Defeat Them. To Return Them to Yomi.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The yokai that block your path are not mere enemies.<br>Uncover the sorrowful truths hidden within Japanese folktales.<br>Why did they become yokai? What memories still bind them?<br>Wield the ōnusa, a sacred Japanese purification wand, touch their hearts, and soothe the lingering souls that cannot move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/86f9182c6f53545e3a1ba2570913e9d8.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/86f9182c6f53545e3a1ba2570913e9d8.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/86f9182c6f53545e3a1ba2570913e9d8.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mononoke Are Adorable, Even When They Need Help</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their village is being invaded by yokai, but the Mononoke still live their gentle, easygoing lives.<br>As the village is restored, you will grow closer to them little by little.<br>Help these strange and cheerful villagers, and spend time by their side.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/9b4c89f610772235e8e5eed39e403afd.avif?t=1783860973\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras_big/9b4c89f610772235e8e5eed39e403afd.avif?t=1783860973 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Boy Carries Musashi’s Fate Forward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To recover Musashi’s soul, the boy must purify eight great yokai and make his way to the serpent god.<br>But is bringing back a lost life truly salvation? The shrine maidens who guide the boy are shrouded in mystery as well.<br>Your journey will change the fate of the puppy and this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/03c5f14a5cf77b01d5362862e73536d8.poster.avif?t=1783860973\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/03c5f14a5cf77b01d5362862e73536d8.webm?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/extras/03c5f14a5cf77b01d5362862e73536d8.mp4?t=1783860973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Because He Wants to Stay with the Puppy, His Only Family, the Boy Chooses This Journey</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please watch over where that wish leads by adding the game to your wishlist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bond-driven action experience where you spend time with Musashi, raise him, and grow stronger together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles that reinterpret Japanese folklore, where you purify yokai with the ōnusa and return them to Yomi to soothe their souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No stamina gauge, satisfying combat with stylish parries, and a casual mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore villages where Mononoke live, and restore a Japanese-inspired otherworld where the gods have fallen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Restore villages, purify yokai, and reclaim a lost world in this Japanese-inspired action-adventure set in an otherworld inhabited by Mononoke. Journey through the corrupted Mononoke no Kuni, recover the stolen soul of Musashi the Shiba Inu, and set out on a grand adventure to return home.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese, Polish, Russian, Korean, Swedish, Portuguese - Brazil, Hindi<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/22662175625179ed36e2d058850fe98b01df52fe/header.jpg?t=1783860973", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/9c7fdad7131d47f2c531e549b4c1ade93e3c22d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783860973", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597610/9c7fdad7131d47f2c531e549b4c1ade93e3c22d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783860973", "website": "https://mononokenokuni.happinet-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong